WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:02.150
Devil fruits in one piece sound pretty simple.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.169
You eat the fruit.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.660
You get a magic power.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:09.889
Some of these powers are pretty simple, like
turning into an animal, while others are so

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:14.450
incredibly confusing and complex they feel
like a whole different power system.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:20.660
In fact, even hardcore fans might not even
know that there are an incredible ELEVEN different

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.350
categories of devil fruits, each with their
own unique rules, special abilities, and powerups.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.380
So let’s break down every single type of
devil fruit in the story.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:33.250
Starting with some quick basics, which is:
what is a devil fruit?

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:38.590
To put it simply, this is a real fruit that
you can actually eat, with the only difference

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.860
being it has inherited a magical ability.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:46.350
And to get that power all a character needs
to do is take a single bite of the fruit and

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.850
they will have their new magic power until
the day they die.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:53.430
Which is rather convenient, because we are
shown over and over again that these fruits

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.850
taste like this guy after he ate the world’s
smelliest fruit.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:01:01.149
However, there is some danger with eating
a devil fruit as well because first, it is

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:04.970
hard to know what power you are going to get
from a particular devil fruit.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:09.060
So you might take a bite and get an awesome
lightning power or you might only be able

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.900
to turn into a cute little dog.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:14.400
Plus there is only one of each power all throughout
the world.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.020
So sorry, you and your friends can’t all
be two fire devil fruit users at the same

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.020
time.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.780
The BIGGEST DOWNSIDE though is that once you
eat a devil fruit you lose the ability to

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.200
swim FOREVER.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:31.680
And if you do happen to fall underwater, well,
you are basically doomed to drown unless there

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.860
is someone around to save you.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:40.680
Which doesn’t sound all that bad until you
remember that like 90% of the one piece world

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.500
is covered by water.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.780
So yeah, it’s a pretty big risk, especially
for a pirate who sails on the sea like our

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.570
main character Luffy.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:55.070
However, most of these abilities are simply
so powerful, that eating the fruit is more

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:56.250
than worth the risk.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:01.960
Starting with our first main category of devil
fruit, which are the Zoan fruits.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:07.430
These fruits are the easiest to understand
because they simply allow the user to transform

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:12.440
from their human form into one specific animal
depending on the devil fruit.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:17.010
And there are some other benefits that we’ll
discuss in just a moment, but of course the

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:21.590
user of these fruits gets all the benefits
you would think of turning into an animal.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:26.569
For example, this guy who ate the Giraffe
devil fruit can now turn into a full on giraffe

00:02:26.569 --> 00:02:31.470
and can bash people with his extra long neck
. And then we have this guy who ate the Falcon

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:35.420
devil fruit, so naturally he can fly with
his massive wings.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:41.000
However, that is only the most basic ability
of this fruit because in addition to a full

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:47.950
animal transformation, the users can also
transform into an animal-human hybrid form.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:53.360
This turns you into a combination of human
and animal with many of your animal characteristics,

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.830
for example, this guy who ate the leopard
fruit.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:03:01.349
Here we can see him in his normal human form,
then his full animal form, and finally his

00:03:01.349 --> 00:03:03.280
animal-human hybrid form.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.840
And a skilled zoan user can change transformations
almost instantly, meaning that you can greatly

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:13.550
enhance your fighting ability by using the
best transformation for the situation.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:18.049
And if you thought that was all there is to
these fruits, then just listen to this because

00:03:18.049 --> 00:03:23.129
on top of everything I’ve already mentioned,
all zoan fruit users get automatic boosts

00:03:23.129 --> 00:03:26.550
to their natural speed, strength, endurance,
and recovery.

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:31.890
What’s even crazier though is if your zoan
fruit is a meat-eating animal - like the leopard

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:36.630
guy we just showed - then you also get even
more boosts in strength and aggression due

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:39.189
to the animal’s natural bloodthirsty nature.

00:03:39.189 --> 00:03:44.730
So yeah, just by eating the fruit, you basically
get a giant level up in your fighting abilities.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:49.700
Now you might be surprised to learn there
are also sub-categories of zoan fruits which

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:55.480
get even MORE POWERFUL, but before we discuss
those, let’s talk about the ULTIMATE POWER

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.170
UP for a Zoan fruit user.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:02.140
Because with any devil fruit in one piece,
the user can unlock a special level of their

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.140
fruit called Awakening.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:09.810
And while it isn’t exactly spelled out how
to do this, we have some idea of how this

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:10.810
works.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.980
Basically, when a person’s mind and body
catch up with the natural will of the fruit,

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:18.359
you can awaken the next level of the fruit.

00:04:18.359 --> 00:04:23.990
So you mentally embrace the spirit of the
fruit and your body is skilled enough in using

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:24.990
the fruit.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:29.750
And to stick with the leopard guy, I guess
you can say that once he fully embraced the

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:35.449
natural will or mindset of a leopard, he was
able to awaken his devil fruit.

00:04:35.449 --> 00:04:42.240
Also, when normal zoans awaken your devil
fruit they get even more boosts to speed,

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.320
strength, endurance, and recovery which makes
you an absolute powerhouse capable of fighting

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.470
against the top-tier fighters in the world.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:57.230
But enough about normal zoans, let’s get
to the even stronger forms of Zoan fruits.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:02.699
The first of these are called Ancient Zoans,
which are still animal devil fruits, but they

00:05:02.699 --> 00:05:05.960
represent animals or creatures from the distant
past.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:11.400
For example, dinosaurs, Woolly Mammoths, and
even a Sabertooth Tiger.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:15.539
And just like normal zoans, these ancient
zoan devil fruit users can transform into

00:05:15.539 --> 00:05:17.919
their hybrid and full animal forms.

00:05:17.919 --> 00:05:22.889
But what separates these fruits from normal
zoans is that they get an even greater boost

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.870
to all their physical abilities.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:28.990
Plus, they straight up just get the awesome
powers of these ancient creatures.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:35.250
I mean they can have super-hard scales, massive
claws and teeth, or even just extreme siz

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.690
which can all be super overpowered during
a fight.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:44.740
As strong as Ancient Zoans are though, they
are NOTHING compared to Mythical Zoans.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:50.069
And honestly, this might be the strongest
category of devil fruits in the entire story

00:05:50.069 --> 00:05:55.430
because these fruits allow the user to become
some mythical creature of legend.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:06:00.460
The best example of this is the Emperor of
the Sea, Kaido, whose mythical devil fruit

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:04.110
allows him to transform into this awesome
dragon.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:07.560
I mean come on, who wouldn’t want to be
a super sized dragon.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:14.389
And to make things even better, each mythical
zoan gets an extra special ability on top

00:06:14.389 --> 00:06:17.610
of the normal zoan physical boosts and transformations.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:22.560
For example, Kaido here can create elemental
attacks like his fiery blast breath that can

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:28.230
literally destroy mountains, summon lightning
strikes, and even create deadly tornados or

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.290
wind slashes.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:35.639
And while this dragon fruit is simply overpowered,
other examples of mythical zoans are the mythical

00:06:35.639 --> 00:06:40.970
nine-tailed fox, which allow the user to shape-shift,
and this mythical phoenix which let him to

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:45.550
use his blue flames to magically heal himself
and others.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.921
Mythical zoans aren’t just restricted to
animal-like creatures either because we even

00:06:49.921 --> 00:06:55.620
have the mythical Buddha who can shoot out
giant shockwaves from his palms.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:07:03.289
So yeah, truly an OP type of devil fruit which
is why we currently only have nine of these

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:04.289
in the story.

00:07:04.289 --> 00:07:10.139
Now, while mythical zoans may have the strongest
abilities, this next main category of devil

00:07:10.139 --> 00:07:13.479
fruits has without a doubt the strongest base
form.

00:07:13.479 --> 00:07:16.949
That’s right, it’s time to discuss Logia
devil fruits.

00:07:16.949 --> 00:07:22.960
And for the longest time we thought these
were straight up the most powerful in the

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:29.590
story because Logia fruits turn you into the
element of substance of that devil fruit.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:34.699
For example, the Lightning logia turns its
user into a lightning human and the Magma

00:07:34.699 --> 00:07:37.220
fruit turns its user into manga.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.169
And you might be thinking, well yeah sure,
that’s cool and all, but is it really that

00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:42.169
OP?

00:07:42.169 --> 00:07:43.370
Well, YES!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:50.820
Because with these elemental transformations,
logia users CANNOT be hurt by normal attacks.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:55.740
Any normal attack will literally just pass
right through the user.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.139
Punches go right through this sand Logia user.

00:07:59.139 --> 00:08:04.539
This explosion breaks this light fruit user’s
body in half, but he can quickly reform himself,

00:08:04.539 --> 00:08:11.039
and even a spear right through the head doesn’t
bother the lightning fruit user at all.

00:08:11.039 --> 00:08:16.190
The only way to actually damage them is by
knowing their elemental weakness, like water

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.009
against sand or rubber against lightning.

00:08:19.009 --> 00:08:23.970
Or if you can’t do that, you can use special
anti-devil fruit stones, use haki, which is

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:28.771
a whole other power system we won’t get
into here, or have a stronger devil fruit

00:08:28.771 --> 00:08:30.430
of a similar element.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:35.080
But as if that wasn’t strong enough there
are even more special abilities of Logia fruit

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.080
users.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:40.339
Because since their body is transformed into
their element, they can freely travel around

00:08:40.339 --> 00:08:43.140
by completely turning into their substance.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:48.800
For example, the light user can become beams
of light to chase down opponents and this

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:53.820
snow logia user can become a cloud of snow
to sneak up behind her enemies.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:58.850
And while that is all great for defense and
movement, Logia users can also produce and

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.920
shoot out their element to fight with.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:06.519
Some great examples of this are this fire
logia user shooting out fire balls, the light

00:09:06.519 --> 00:09:12.180
logia user shooting light bullets, and even
this guy blasting off giant magma fists to

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.290
crush and burn his enemies.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.630
Logia users can also make swords of their
element.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:22.670
Plus some logia users like the swamp logia
or the darkness logia also let their users

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:28.070
trap people or objects inside a kinda pocket
dimension inside themselves.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:34.630
Which is just INSANE that all of this is just
the normal abilities of a logia user.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.329
Now do you believe me that these are the strongest
base form devil fruits?

00:09:38.329 --> 00:09:42.710
And we haven’t even got to the Logia’s
ultimate power, which is of course awakening.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:48.370
First, though I have to say that Logia’s
awakening has never been 100% confirmed.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:55.350
However, we can roughly guess that Logia awakenings
turn their entire environment into that person’s

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.390
elemental ability.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:10:00.940
The best possible example we have of this
is when the ice and magma logia users had

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:07.490
a MASSIVE fight and left an entire island
permanently changed into half frozen mountains

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.470
and half volcanic wasteland.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:15.589
Now if we are considering all the categories
of devil fruits, this next main category might

00:10:15.589 --> 00:10:16.649
be the weakest.

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:22.610
However, it contains what I believe are some
of the most powerful individual fruits in

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:23.779
the entire story.

00:10:23.779 --> 00:10:29.790
It’s time to discuss the Paramecia devil
fruits, which can be broken into three main

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.750
subcategories.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:37.430
The first of these is Body Alteration, which
basically means a devil fruit will change

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.520
the user’s body in some very specific way.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:45.010
We’ve seen examples of this all throughout
the story like this guy, who has become a

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:49.560
blade human and can transform any part of
his body into blades.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:54.800
Or this guy here who can transform any part
of his body into super hard diamond that can

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.950
even block attacks from the world’s strongest
swordsman.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:04.010
But for an even crazier example, we have this
woman who can turn any part of her body into

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.040
any weapon she can imagine.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.750
Swords, guns, massive bazookas.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.500
You name it, she can transform into it.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.079
Bet you’ve never seen that power in another
anime.

00:11:15.079 --> 00:11:21.910
So yeah, Body Alteration Paramecias can change
your body in a ton of super creative ways.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:28.170
But the next sub-category is even more overpowered
because we also have Environment Manipulation

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.630
Paramecias.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:35.420
And instead of changing a user’s body, these
fruits give the user the ability to affect

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.260
the environment in some way.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:44.690
For example, this marine admiral can alter
gravity to force people to the ground or even

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:47.430
pull down meteors from space.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.350
I mean, how crazy is that?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.980
Another perfect example is Luffy’s former
rival who can control magnetism which means

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:59.940
that he can pull or push any metal and create
metal body parts or weapons.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:05.140
That’s just the start though because the
next subcategory of Paramecia fruits let the

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:09.370
user produce AND control some substance.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:14.630
This is similar to Logia abilities, but these
users can ONLY produce their given substance

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.890
and control it, not completely turn into the
substance.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:24.490
For example, this former Warlord can produce
a nearly endless amount of string to slash,

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:28.209
shoot as bullets, and even control people
like puppets.

00:12:28.209 --> 00:12:32.430
Then there’s this little girl who can produce
these little kibi dango balls and when she

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.510
feeds them to animals will let her command
those animals around.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:42.140
And just like Zoans and Logias, the Paramecia
devil fruits also have an ultimate awakening.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:48.200
In general, this final power up allows the
user to directly use their power on the environment.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:52.630
The easiest way to explain it is to look at
some examples like the string user actually

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:59.660
turning his entire environment into string
that he can then control.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:04.880
Or to go back to the magnetism user, he could
make parts of his environment or even people

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.050
magnetic to trap them against a wall.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:12.339
What makes Paramecias a bit more confusing
though is that there are some Paramecia’s

00:13:12.339 --> 00:13:16.670
that don’t exactly fit into these categories.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.300
We’ll call this the Other Category.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:24.160
For example, there is this little girl’s
Parameica fruit that is absolutely broken.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.220
Just listen to this.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:31.839
With a single touch, she can turn anyone into
a little toy AND THEN force them into a contract

00:13:31.839 --> 00:13:34.800
where they have to obey her every command.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:41.200
On top of that, everybody that person ever
knew instantly forgets they even exist.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:46.709
Plus this girl has her age immediately frozen,
which basically makes her forever young.

00:13:46.709 --> 00:13:50.070
So yeah, good luck figuring out how to categorize
that fruit.

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:54.760
Then there is also this guy’s fruit, who
can make this magical dome where he can do

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:57.042
almost anything he wants within the dome.

00:13:57.042 --> 00:14:02.070
Slice off body parts, swap personalities,
and even teleport.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.070
He can do it all.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:09.050
But the most amazing thing is this fruit has
a special ability to grant eternal youth to

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:12.850
one person, but it costs the fruit user their
life.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:17.990
Which again is just such a broken ability
that doesn’t really fit into any of the

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:18.990
categories.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:24.060
However, while these fruits are tough to categorize
there is one devil fruit that the author had

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:27.640
to officially create a brand new category
for.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:33.870
This is the Mochi devil fruit, which was originally
going to be a Logia fruit, but was later changed

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:38.300
to a brand new category called Special Paramecia.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:44.230
Now, normally Paramecia fruits get one of
the abilities we mentioned before: Body Adaptation,

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.509
Environment Manipulation, or Producing a Substance.

00:14:47.509 --> 00:14:52.670
But what’s special about the mochi fruit
is that it has both body adaptation meaning

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:56.610
his body can become mochi AND he can produce
mochi.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:15:02.420
Which almost makes it like a logia fruit,
except that the user’s body isn’t immune

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.950
to normal attacks.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:09.810
And even awakening this fruit lets the user
transform his environment into sticky mochi,

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:15.540
so it is literally the perfect trifecta of
Paramecia powers.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:20.550
The MOST MYSTERIOUS thing about all these
devil fruits though is that we aren’t entirely

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.110
sure where they came from.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.930
I mean we do know that there is only one of
each specific devil fruit in the world at

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:27.930
a time.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:32.699
And we also know that when a devil fruit user
dies their power is reincarnated into another

00:15:32.699 --> 00:15:35.740
fruit so a different person can eat it.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.199
But we don’t officially know where they
come from.

00:15:38.199 --> 00:15:42.550
They could have originally grown on some kind
of devil fruit tree or been made scientifically

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.720
in the distant past.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:49.550
In fact, this last explanation might actually
be the truth because we have seen two types

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:53.009
of scientifically made devil fruits in the
story.

00:15:53.009 --> 00:15:57.980
The first type is straight up evil because
the artificial SMILE devil fruits are twisted

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.620
versions of Zoan fruits.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:03.440
Basically, this SMILE fruit will give the
user some sort of animal power.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:06.930
But it isn’t even a normal zoan-like transformation.

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:12.029
Instead you are permanently stuck with some
kind of animal part on your body like this

00:16:12.029 --> 00:16:17.710
guy who has a lion head as a stomach or this
bat guy who just always has bat wings.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:22.370
Or my favorite are these two who just look
so ridiculous.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:28.090
The worst part though is that only one out
of every ten SMILE fruits actually gives you

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:33.079
an animal power, and the other nine leave
the people who ate them with a horrible curse

00:16:33.079 --> 00:16:36.620
that they can only laugh for the rest of their
lives.

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:39.730
Seriously, these things are completely messed
up.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:46.430
However, not all scientific devil fruits are
flawed because the world’s best scientist

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:51.089
basically perfectly recreated the mythical
dragon devil fruit which gave this boy the

00:16:51.089 --> 00:16:55.310
exact same powers of the legendary dragon.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:17:01.640
On top of that, this same scientist was able
to extract devil fruit DNA and recreate the

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:04.600
powers in genetically engineered clones.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:10.380
So in theory, he could make copies of any
devil fruit power in the world, which is honestly

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.510
a scary thought.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:16.130
I mean can you just imagine how terrifying
an entire army of devil fruit users would

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.130
be?

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:21.610
We could have ten ultra-destructive lightning
fruit users, or fifty mythical Phoenixes flying

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:22.610
around.

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:26.770
Or worst of all, what if there were one hundred
Pocket fruit users to trap everyone in their

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.000
creepy body pockets?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:34.190
And those are just some of the insanely powerful
and wacky devil fruit powers in the story,

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:39.630
and if you want to learn about literally every
single devil fruit ability that exists in

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:42.610
one piece you can check out this video right
here.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:45.690
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

